  {
    "date_created": "2025-07-01T14:38:34.598Z",
    "date_updated": "2025-07-01T14:43:13.137Z",
    "id": "6",
    "name_not_used": "GUESTHOUSE_ACC",
    "status": "published",
    "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
    "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
    "accordion_items": [
      {
        "accordion_id": "6",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">A cozy welcome area combines living room comfort and old-school bar charm, featuring ample couches, board games, and a vinyl record player for a relaxed, inviting atmosphere.</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T14:40:34.580Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-01T14:45:42.752Z",
        "header": "Accommodation",
        "id": "11",
        "main_image": "80f5e81f-5b1a-4c06-b74d-be0c4f1cb62f",
        "sort": "0",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5"
      },
      {
        "accordion_id": "6",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">The entire outside area of around 2000m² can be used by our guests. The front yard is an excellent spot for leisure time and relaxed evenings by the fire. The back garden is where you’ll find our veggies, berries and herbs, and ample space to touch some actual grass.</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T14:41:46.975Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-01T14:45:55.827Z",
        "header": "Bar & Lounge",
        "id": "12",
        "main_image": "48c365d2-e9f7-42ce-bc4e-49cca6b8299c",
        "sort": "1",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5"
      },
      {
        "accordion_id": "6",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">Our Co-working provides a calm working environment, screens and keyboards, bicycles can be borrowed to explore the surroundings, several workshops contain lots of tools and materials like fabric, paint and wood to become creative, and a piano and other instruments are available for a jam.</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T14:42:27.619Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-01T14:46:08.149Z",
        "header": "Gardens",
        "id": "13",
        "main_image": "8b60bc3d-0411-40c7-9970-832d583aef24",
        "sort": "1",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5"
      },
      {
        "accordion_id": "6",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">90m² fit up to 75 seats facing a 3x6m stage with a massive sound system and a ceiling-mounted projector with a 133’’ drop-down screen. Wireless microphones, two wall-mounted cameras and a tripod-mounted camera feed into a 4-channel video mixer that supports live video streaming and production.</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T14:43:02.155Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-01T14:46:18.557Z",
        "header": "Other Amenities",
        "id": "14",
        "main_image": "01de3901-23c4-4369-9854-9c6fe05ff9fb",
        "sort": "3",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5"
      }
    ],
    "page_accordion": [],
    "category_accordion": [
      "1"
    ],
    "post_accordion": []
  },
  {
    "date_created": "2025-07-01T14:53:52.726Z",
    "date_updated": "2025-07-01T14:57:11.053Z",
    "id": "7",
    "name_not_used": "EVENT_LOCATION_ACC",
    "status": "published",
    "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
    "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
    "accordion_items": [
      {
        "accordion_id": "7",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">Next to the main stage, the Event Hall, also offering 90m², is a more open space that lends itself to workshops, breakout sessions and as space that can be used for co-working. Typically, events start their mornings in a big circle to map out the day’s schedule on a whiteboard.&nbsp;</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T14:54:23.864Z",
        "date_updated": null,
        "header": "Main Stage & Hall",
        "id": "15",
        "main_image": "f6e38335-40a6-4b4c-bfc3-6471c067c38f",
        "sort": "0",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": null
      },
      {
        "accordion_id": "7",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">As a part of the event hall, a fully equipped plug-and-play podcast studio enables spontaneous and well-planned media production. Guests can easily record their thoughts, presentations, and conversations without being bogged down by technical or spatial challenges.</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T14:55:59.133Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-01T14:57:25.307Z",
        "header": "Event Hall",
        "id": "16",
        "main_image": "df70fb04-c9d2-433d-8446-9cf8a0e8b629",
        "sort": "0",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5"
      },
      {
        "accordion_id": "7",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">The 40m² co-working doubles as a dedicated seminar room for smaller events, featuring a 65’’ TV, 20 chairs, a whiteboard, and adaptable and versatile tables and seating arrangements, ideal for workshops or meetings.</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T14:56:38.703Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-01T14:57:32.499Z",
        "header": "Video Podcast Studio",
        "id": "17",
        "main_image": "4e7c8805-b7f5-4743-ba18-aa44ebf99568",
        "sort": "0",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5"
      },
      {
        "accordion_id": "7",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">Numerous beaches along river Schwarza invite for swimming and sun bathing in walking distance from the Hub</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T14:57:09.851Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-01T14:57:41.482Z",
        "header": "Co-Working Space",
        "id": "18",
        "main_image": "01de3901-23c4-4369-9854-9c6fe05ff9fb",
        "sort": "0",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5"
      }
    ],
