  {
    "date_created": "2025-09-25T08:21:15.129Z",
    "date_updated": "2025-09-25T11:49:31.183Z",
    "id": "10",
    "name_not_used": "HIKING & CLIMBING",
    "status": "published",
    "user_created": "258593a6-4999-4401-8ea6-5959100f1278",
    "user_updated": "258593a6-4999-4401-8ea6-5959100f1278",
    "accordion_items": [
      {
        "accordion_id": "10",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">The Schneeberg and Rax Plateau provide ample opportunities for hiking, biking, rock climbing, rafting, kayaking, swimming and mushroom foraging. <br><br><strong>Hikes </strong>range from <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\" href=\"https://www.wieneralpen.at/a-1-wiener-wasserleitungsweg\">short walks along the river</a> up to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\" href=\"https://www.bergfex.com/sommer/niederoesterreich/touren/\">multi-day tours up and across Rax and Schneeberg</a>, all starting from or near the Hub.</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">Over 2000 climbing routes, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\" href=\"https://www.tiefoben.at/stadelwand-durststrecke/\">many of them multi-pitch</a>, make the area a prime destination for adventurers and rock climbers from Vienna, Bratislava, Budapest and beyond.&nbsp;</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-09-25T08:36:55.208Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-09-25T11:49:29.208Z",
        "header": "HIKING",
        "id": "24",
        "main_image": "5c842eca-49ad-4afc-b48d-f90734bd0f2a",
        "sort": "1",
        "user_created": "258593a6-4999-4401-8ea6-5959100f1278",
        "user_updated": "258593a6-4999-4401-8ea6-5959100f1278"
      }
    ],
